<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Inter 1 (Angloma 40th minute) Lazio 1 (Signori 33). Halftime</p>
<p>1-1. Attendance: 52,000</p>
<p>Parma 3 (Grun 11 - own-goal, Chiesa 40 - penalty, Zola 60)</p>
<p>Reggiana 2 (Sabau 26, Tovalieri 58). 2-1. 24,000</p>
<p>Roma 1 (Balbo 53) Sampdoria 4 (Montella 64, 74 and 90,</p>
<p>Mancini 88). 0-0. 59,000</p>
</text>
